  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0076_607079e5f376.png\" style=\"width: 360px; height: 75px;\" /><br /><br />Now: <math><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.303</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.693</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>14.5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mn>0.25</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1.778</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.175</mn></math><br /><br />Total pressure <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0.175</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.175</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.175</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />now: <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn></math>"
